OL,3,GNEWSA'Tired' mum starts SEND group for
OL,4,Astruggling parents
OL,5,
OL,6,FKim White started the SEND Sisterhood
OL,7,Fbecause she was tired.
OL,9,FTired of the forms and assessments, the
OL,10,Ffighting to get her autistic son who
OL,11,Fhas muscular dystrophy and epilepsy the
OL,12,Fhelp he needs and having to explain her
OL,13,Fson's needs to people who she said
OL,14,F'don't quite get it'.
OL,16,FThe Coventry mum said the Sisterhood -
OL,17,Fwhich meets once a month - is not a
OL,18,Fsupport group as such, but somewhere
OL,19,Fparents can gather and offload with a
OL,20,Fcoffee and slice of cake.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
